Recently, polymer has been produced wherein lithium initiated polymer chains are contacted with a coupling agent to join two or more polymer molecules together. In accordance with this invention, the effluent from a lithium initiated polymerization wherein the polymer molecules have been contacted with a coupling agent having at least two reactive sites, with the resultant generation of LiO--, LiS-- or ##STR1## groups, is treated with carbon dioxide and an excess of water and stabilized with an antioxidant system comprising a phosphite, a glycine, and a hindered phenol. DESCRIPTION OF THE PREFERRED EMBODIMENTS 
